=== Sample Size and Power

With approximately 50 high-affinity ME/CFS participants (from 75 enrolled) and 3 imaging timepoints per subject:
    - 80% power to detect Spearman $rho$=0.35 between TSPO-PET and PEM recovery time at $alpha$=0.05, assuming the published variance
    - The study is not powered for PEM-trajectory, genotype, or region-specific subgroup tests; those are exploratory
    - The n=25 activity-matched comparator arm can detect only a large group difference; it is a calibration arm, not a powered hypothesis test
    - A null result in the comparator arm cannot exclude a small difference
